T("Off: full resolution. AMD FSR 1: renders smaller, then upscales.", "关：完整分辨率。AMD FSR 1：以较小分辨率渲染后放大。")
T("Off: the 3D image renders at the window's resolution. AMD FSR 1: it renders smaller (the mode below), then FSR 1's edge-aware upscaling and sharpening bring it to the window. The HUD and menus always render at the window's resolution.\n\nAMD FSR 3 and NVIDIA DLSS (NVIDIA RTX graphics cards) are coming in a later version.", "关：3D画面以窗口的分辨率渲染。AMD FSR 1：以较小的分辨率渲染（下方的模式），再由FSR 1考虑边缘的放大和锐化放大到窗口大小。画面显示和菜单始终以窗口的分辨率渲染。\n\nAMD FSR 3和NVIDIA DLSS（NVIDIA RTX显卡）将在以后的版本中推出。")
T("How the game's image (1920 x 1080) is scaled up to a bigger window. Off: plain (bilinear) scaling. MetalFX: Apple's upscaler, sharper.\n\nRendering below the window's size (the modes below) is coming in a later version.", "游戏画面（1920 x 1080）放大到更大窗口的方式。关：简单的（双线性）放大。MetalFX：Apple的放大技术，更清晰。\n\n以低于窗口的分辨率渲染（下方的模式）将在以后的版本中推出。")
