T("Keeps the textures of ground, paths and walls sharp where you look along them into the distance. Off: the game's own filtering, as on the console. 16x is the sharpest and costs very little on a PC graphics card.", "沿着地面、道路和墙壁望向远处时，让它们的纹理保持清晰。关：游戏本身的过滤，与主机相同。16x最清晰，在PC显卡上几乎没有开销。")
T("AMD FidelityFX CAS sharpens the 3D image after the upscaler (or at the window's resolution with the upscaler off), before the HUD is drawn over it: edges get crisper without halos. Most useful with AMD FSR 1.", "AMD FidelityFX CAS在放大之后（关闭放大时以窗口的分辨率）、在画面显示绘制到上面之前锐化3D画面：边缘更清晰且没有光晕。与AMD FSR 1搭配最有用。")
T("Asynchronous shaders", "异步着色器")
T("Off: the game waits for each new shader to compile, a short stutter the first time an effect appears, and everything is drawn. On: no waiting, but what needs a shader still compiling is skipped meanwhile: effects pop in late, and pictures the game draws only once (the save file's screenshot) can come out as garbage.", "关：游戏会等待每个新着色器编译完成，效果首次出现时会短暂卡顿，但所有内容都会绘制。开：不等待，但需要仍在编译中的着色器的内容会暂时跳过：效果会延迟出现，游戏只绘制一次的图像（存档的截图）可能出现错乱。")
