T("On suits G-SYNC and FreeSync. Fast: no tearing and no waiting.", "G-SYNC和FreeSync请选“开”。快速：无撕裂也无等待。")
T("On: no tearing; the game waits for the display. With G-SYNC or FreeSync the display waits for the game instead: each frame shows as soon as it's ready, and the frame rate stays a little under the display's refresh rate. Fast: no tearing and no waiting: each refresh shows the newest frame. Adaptive: as On, but a frame that comes late shows at once and may tear. Off: each frame shows at once: the least delay, but it tears.", "开：无画面撕裂；游戏等待显示器。使用G-SYNC或FreeSync时则由显示器等待游戏：每帧一准备好就显示，帧率保持在显示器刷新率稍下。快速：无撕裂也无等待：每次刷新显示最新的一帧。自适应：同“开”，但迟到的帧会立即显示，可能撕裂。关：每帧立即显示：延迟最低，但画面会撕裂。")
T("With On and Adaptive, the frame rate on this display goes up to about %d FPS.", "使用“开”和“自适应”时，此显示器上的帧率最高约为%d FPS。")
T("How many pictures a second the game draws. The game itself runs at the same speed at every rate (the console runs it at 30). Higher rates need a faster computer. Menus, cutscenes and conversations use it too, and videos play at their own speed. Off: as many as the computer can draw.", "游戏每秒绘制的画面数。游戏本身在任何帧率下速度都相同（主机上为30）。更高的帧率需要更快的电脑。菜单、过场动画和对话也使用此帧率，视频则按自身速度播放。关：电脑能画多少就画多少。")
T("Your display refreshes %d times a second: a rate above that shows no more pictures, and one that divides it evenly is the smoothest.", "你的显示器每秒刷新%d次：高于此值的帧率不会显示更多画面，能整除它的帧率最流畅。")
