T("Automatic: in HDR while Windows HDR is on, as bright as in SDR. Off: always SDR.", "自动：Windows HDR 开启时以 HDR 输出，亮度与 SDR 相同。关：始终 SDR。")
T("Automatic: while Windows HDR is on for this display, the picture is sent in HDR, so it looks as bright and colourful as in SDR (in SDR, Windows shows it dim and dull then). On: always in HDR, where the display takes it. Off: always SDR. White follows Windows' SDR content brightness (Settings > System > Display > HDR).", "自动：此显示器开启 Windows HDR 时，画面以 HDR 输出，看起来与 SDR 一样明亮鲜艳（若为 SDR，Windows 会显示得暗淡发灰）。开：只要显示器支持，始终 HDR。关：始终 SDR。白色亮度跟随 Windows 的 SDR 内容亮度（设置 > 系统 > 屏幕 > HDR）。")
