T("Twice the frames on screen. Adds a little delay.", "屏幕上的帧数翻倍。会增加少许延迟。")
T("AMD FSR 3 makes a frame between each two the game draws: about twice the frames on screen. The frame rate above counts them all, so the game itself draws half of it (60 with 120) and the controls answer as at that rate, a little later. In play only: the menus and the map show the game's own frames. Fast moves can leave faint smears around Link and what moves on its own.", "AMD FSR 3在游戏绘制的每两帧之间生成一帧：屏幕上的帧数约为两倍。上方的帧率计入所有帧，所以游戏本身只绘制一半（选120时为60），操作的响应和该帧率相同，略有延迟。仅在游玩时：菜单和地图显示游戏自身的帧。快速移动时，林克和自行移动的物体周围可能留下淡淡的拖影。")
